WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.695
Semi-structured data has some organization without
requiring every record to look exactly the same

00:00:07.451 --> 00:00:12.968
JSON is a common example Fields have names but
values

00:00:12.994 --> 00:00:19.156
can be nested and different records may contain
different keys That flexibility

00:00:19.182 --> 00:00:25.694
is useful for APIs devices logs and fast-changing
applications The

00:00:25.721 --> 00:00:30.970
tradeoff is that analysts often need to flatten
records handle optional fields and manage schema

00:00:30.984 --> 00:00:32.457
changes before analysis
